9067e6f3","content_digest":"0c7c6b380fc362d39ca68623781b224a8b88021c99c6227de4b38220124ef62f","digest_version":2,"scope":{"tag":null,"layers":["content","plate_buff_f1"],"frames":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},"status":"passed","method":"frames_and_timing","summary":"Viewed the contact sheet of all 9 frames plus earlier 8x previews, x4 exports and the 50%/100% overview. Nine static 32x32 icons, same steel plate, D01 colors only, no technical failures or warnings.","visual_checks":[{"criterion_id":"requirements","verdict":"pass","reason":"9 frames, 32x32, one icon per frame as in D36 section 2; user approved the 9 drafts (Q1) on 2026-10-28."},{"criterion_id":"silhouette","verdict":"pass","reason":"Ball on paddle, twin barrels with bullets, red brick behind steel plate, SP +/- with paddle, HP + with one or three green bricks, ringed ball, dashed paddle with sparkles are all distinct in the contact sheet; 1 px K outlines."},{"criterion_id":"color_detail","verdict":"pass","reason":"Left-top light, shared D01 steel/pearl/green/orange ramps; no dithering or stray noise seen. Blackhole ring and invisible dashes are the lowest contrast but readable."},{"criterion_id":"motion","verdict":"pass","reason":"Not applicable: single static frames, nothing moves."},{"criterion_id":"timing","verdict":"pass","reason":"Not applicable: single static frames at 160 ms, no loop."},{"criterion_id":"custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"All 9 compared with their D32 item previews; objects and layout match."},{"criterion_id":"custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"White text, ball highlight, paddle highlights and dashes read on the #566077 plate; dimmer at 50% but still visible (D34 already accepts this)."},{"criterion_id":"custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content bounds per frame stay within x 3-28, y 4-28; nothing touches the 2 px bevel."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_sticky:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Pearl ball resting on a cyan-capped paddle matches item_sticky."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_sticky:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Ball is pale but its shading and the white highlight show on the gray plate; weakest at 50% yet visible."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_sticky:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 7-24, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_gun:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Two steel barrels on the paddle with two yellow bullets above match item_gun."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_gun:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Yellow bullets and light steel barrels clearly separate from the plate."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_gun:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 5-25, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invincible:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Red brick behind a steel plate with yellow stud matches item_invincible."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invincible:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Red brick and light steel plate contrast strongly with the plate; the 4x4 yellow stud is small but visible."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invincible:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 6-25, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_up:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"SP + over a paddle matches item_paddle_speed; same shape as the minus version except the top-right symbol."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_up:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"White 2 px glyphs and bright paddle stand out on the plate."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_up:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 4-24, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_down:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"SP - over a paddle matches item_paddle_speed_down; identical to the plus icon except the symbol."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_down:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"White glyphs and paddle clearly visible; the minus is a thin 2 px bar but readable."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_paddle_speed_down:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 4-24, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"HP + over a single green brick matches item_heal."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"White HP and bright green brick contrast well with the plate."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 4-25, x 4-27, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal_area:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"HP + over three stair-stepped green bricks matches item_heal_area and is distinct from the single-brick heal icon."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal_area:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Bricks and white text are clear; overlapping brick outlines stay readable."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_heal_area:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans y 4-28, x 4-27; lowest brick edge at y 28 touches the edge of the 26x26 box but not the bevel."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_blackhole:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Dark indigo ball with an orange ring matches item_blackhole at a smaller scale."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_blackhole:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"Orange ring is bright; the dark ball is dark on gray but outlined; dimmer at 50% yet clear."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_blackhole:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reason":"Content spans x 3-28, y 9-22, inside the box."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invisible:custom_1","verdict":"pass","reason":"Four dashed segments plus two sparkles match item_invisible."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invisible:custom_2","verdict":"pass","reason":"White dashes and sparkles are visible on the plate; lowest contrast of the set at 50%, noted as a known risk."},{"criterion_id":"tag:d36_hud_icon_invisible:custom_3","verdict":"pass","reaso